<li>Taman Industri Agtex Long Bình - AGTEX 28, 43 ha</li>
<li>Taman Industri Tam Phước, 323 ha</li>
</ul>
Sanyang Motor's Vietnam Manufacturing &amp; Export Processing Co., Ltd. (VMEP) berada di Biên Hòa.
